=====================================

## ABOUT
========
emu16K is the reference emulator for the rezoid rzd16K
processor, written in C++03. it attempts to be
cycle-accurate and accurate to the rzd16K specification.

## COMPILING
============
on a unix-like machine, simply run:
$ make -f mkf
to compile and run the executable, run:
$ make -f mkf run
to remove the executable, run:
$ make -f mkf clr

